@MarketeersInsuranceRenew
#DIM renewCost
IF HealthInsuranceLevel
	renewCost = HealthInsuranceCost:HealthInsuranceLevel
	renewCost += HealthInsuranceDebt
	; SIF !MAIN_MAP
	;     renewCost = 30
	IF MONEY:2 < renewCost
		PRINTFORML 돈이 떨어져서 보험 계약이 종료되었다.
		HealthInsuranceLevel = 0
		HealthInsuranceSignDay = 0
	ELSE
		;custom code, show cm cost and current charisma
		PRINTFORML 건강 보험 계약을 갱신하시겠습니까?
		PRINTFORML 현재 플랜: %HealthInsuranceLabels:HealthInsuranceLevel% (%金額表示(renewCost)%)
		PRINTFORML 부채: %金額表示(HealthInsuranceDebt)%
		PRINTFORML 갱신 비용: %金額表示(renewCost)%
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORML 현재 금액: %金額表示(MONEY)%
		CALL ASK_YN
		IF !RESULT
			PRINTFORMW 계약이 갱신되었다.
			CALL PAY_MONEY_YEN(renewCost, 2)
			HealthInsuranceSignDay = DAY
			HealthInsuranceDebt = 0
		ELSE
			HealthInsuranceLevel = 0
			HealthInsuranceSignDay = 0
			PRINTFORMW 계약은 해지될 것이다.
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
